WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.800
ccLoad. The self-hosted AI API gateway.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:11.300
Rely on a single key and you will get stuck: rate limits, outages, and costs you can't see.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:21.300
ccLoad gives you one entry point and many routes. It picks channels by priority, and when one is rate limited, it fails over to the next.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:27.300
Any client, any upstream. Protocols are converted on the fly.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:34.300
Every dollar is visible: requests, tokens and cost, by channel, model and token.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.800
Upstream credentials stay in the gateway. Clients only get a scoped ccLoad token.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:43.700
Deploy in minutes with a single command.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:47.500
ccLoad. Open source, self-hosted. Try it today.

